2 CONT February 1901. That birth act gives him, self-declaring at 21, as a *daglooner* — where
2 CONT his own 1900 marriage act (S28) gives *polijster*. Both trades are kept on their own
2 CONT records; a labourer's trade moving within a year is not a conflict.
2 CONT
2 CONT His own birth is independently corroborated by a further act, the Sint-Stevens-Woluwe
2 CONT register entry his parents' ages are checked against on [[bossin_joannes_1834]] and [[wolf_maria_1836]]'s
2 CONT records (S33): his father aged 45, *landbouwer*, and his mother aged 43, both matching
2 CONT their marriage-act birthdates exactly.
