2 CONT chain of 1687-1700. Reading the actual page ([[bundervoet-fiefs-alost-1687-1701]]) shows the
2 CONT snippets had merged two adjacent entries: the Meirelbeke 1587 one belongs to the surname VAN
2 CONT DEN BUNDERE, not Bundervoet.
