2 CONT **1687 to 1701** — Catherine as widow and guardian in 1687, then Liévin son of François and
2 CONT Liévin son of Pasquier in 1700, and Pasquier son of Liévin in 1701. Descent stated, in the
2 CONT right century, some 30 km from Evergem. A lead for objective 3, and still not a link.
