2 CONT
2 CONT FATHER of Édouard Dekeyser — the long-sought wall, now broken. Named (with his wife) in Édouard's 1946 remarriage act as 'zoon van Desiderius en van Maria Theresia Van den Broeck, beiden overleden'. A Hamme (Oost-Vlaanderen) family (his son Mauritius Eduardus married in Hamme in 1912; his son Édouard was born in Hamme in 1876). Both parents were already deceased by 9 May 1946. Their known children (FamilySearch, Oost-Vlaanderen civil registration): Édouard (1876, our line), Mauritius Eduardus (1892, m. Marie Henriette Neus, Hamme 1912), Augustinus (†1883 as an infant), Frederiens Carolus, and Leontinus Josephus de Keyser. His own dates/parents are the new frontier — pursue in the Hamme (O.-Vl.) registers (AGATHA / FamilySearch).
