2 CONT CORROBORATED (July 2026) by a Doodsprentjes.be memorial-card record: born Stene
2 CONT 12 April 1908, died Oostende 22 September 1991, partner Van Iseghem. The birthplace of
2 CONT Stene — a detail easy to get wrong, since she died at Oostende which absorbed it — comes
2 CONT back exactly as held, which is what makes the identification safe.
2 CONT
2 CONT CORROBORATED (2026-07-26): the vrijwilligersrab Geboorten index carries her birth as
2 CONT Stene, 12 April 1908, act nr. 29 — matching this record to the day. The index row has
2 CONT not been read as an act image, so confidence stays sup; the act reference is recorded
2 CONT here as corroboration only, for the next pass to pull.
2 CONT
