2 CONT (vrijwilligersrab Huwelijken index, `rab-bs-huwelijken`) — names her parents in full as
2 CONT Devriendt Eugenius Alphonsius × Schalandryn Octavia Maria, matching this tree's already
2 CONT `doc`-confirmed [[devriendt_eugenius_1882]] × [[schalandrijn_octavia_1886]] exactly (from an unrelated 1906
2 CONT marriage act, S20), and the groom's parents as Eduardus Van Iseghem × Emma Celesta
2 CONT Vincke, matching [[vaniseghem_joannes_1903]]'s own held parents. Both sides were already linked in
2 CONT this tree; this act supplies the marriage date and place, not a new link. See
2 CONT [[vaniseghem_joannes_1903]]'s record for a chronology question this same act raises.
2 CONT
2 CONT **A CHILD NOT IN THE TREE, NOT GRAFTED (2026-07-27).** See [[vaniseghem_joannes_1903]]'s record for a
2 CONT death-index row naming this couple as parents of "Roger Bernard", Stene, 27/02/1929 —
