1 NOTE Married at 19; lived her whole life in Oostende, reaching 73.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her own birth act — Oostende, 5 July 1853, act nr. 238, RAB ID 1458582 — confirms her
2 CONT father/mother links, until now sourced from a single Geneanet tree (tree-gverdievel)
2 CONT alone: both parents are named in full, "JANSSEN Josephus Joannes x HUYGHEBAERT Appolonia
2 CONT Joanna", matching this record exactly. What changed is not the fact but its basis: a
2 CONT civil-act index, independent of that member tree, now stands behind it.
2 CONT
2 CONT **HER OWN DEATH ACT (2026-07-27)** — Oostende, 13 November 1926, act nr. 611, RAB ID
2 CONT 2201502 — gives Birth Date 05/07/1853, matching her held birth to the day, and names her
2 CONT partner "VANISEGHEM Joannes", matching [[vaniseghem_joannes_1852]] exactly. Both her parents are
2 CONT restated in full, agreeing with her own birth act above.
2 CONT
2 CONT **A THIRD, INDEPENDENT PRIMARY SOURCE FOR THE SAME LINK (2026-07-27), DOC-GRADE.** Her son
2 CONT [[vaniseghem_eduardus_1880]]'s own 1907 marriage act, read as a register image
2 CONT ([[fs-oostende-1907-marriage-vaniseghem-vincke]],
2 CONT `data/artifacts/vaniseghem-vincke-1907-marriage-oostende.md`), names her present and
2 CONT consenting, *"zonder beroep"*. A different register from both her own birth and death
2 CONT acts, 26 years before the latter — a third, wholly independent primary attestation of the
2 CONT [[vaniseghem_joannes_1852]] × [[janssen_hermanie_1853]] → [[vaniseghem_eduardus_1880]] link. This record's own vital
2 CONT dates remain index-only, so confidence stays `sup`.
2 CONT
2 CONT **EIGHT CHILDREN with [[vaniseghem_joannes_1852]] — see his record for the full sibship, the
2 CONT identifier that grounds it (a province-wide sweep found nine different men recorded
2 CONT identically as "Joannes Vaniseghem", so the parent PAIR, not the father's name alone, is
2 CONT what carries this), the two unnamed infant deaths that are not counted among the eight,
2 CONT and the narrowed negative on an unrecorded daughter.** Filtering the birth index by her
2 CONT own surname independently returns the identical eight RAB IDs found from her husband's
2 CONT side — no rival couple, no ninth child.
