2 CONT Jean, M: DECLERCK Victoire", French register forms. **Checked explicitly against the
2 CONT duplicate-id trap**: 623503 is not 574198 — a different register (geboorten vs
2 CONT huwelijken), a different RAB ID, a different FamilySearch waypoint and film, so this is a
