2 TYPE project-id
1 NAME Marie Anne Catherine (Kinart) /Quinart/
2 GIVN Marie Anne Catherine (Kinart)
2 SURN Quinart
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1780
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1855
1 FAMS @F166@
1 NOTE Wife of the carpenter Georges Lambert Thumas (m. 1801); mother of ten, including Georges (1804).
2 CONT
2 CONT CORROBORATED (July 2026), and it turned up a child. The Grez-Doiceau death act of
2 CONT 18 October 1812 for a boy named **Etienne Thumas** gives his parents as *Lambert Thumas* and
2 CONT *Marie Catherine Quinart* — this couple, which had stood on the m2155 tree alone.
2 CONT
2 CONT FRONTIER: Etienne himself. He is a son of [[thumas_georges_1772]] and this record, and so a
2 CONT brother of [[thumas_georges_1804]], and he is not in the tree. The act has not been opened, so his
2 CONT birth date and his age at death are unread; opening it would place him.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO INDEXED BY FAMILYSEARCH (July 2026), which lists the 1812 Grez-Doiceau death of her son
2 CONT Etienne with his parents given as *Lambert Thumas* and *Marie Catherine Quinart* — the same
2 CONT act already registered as [[S13]], reached independently through a second index. Her surname
2 CONT appears there in several spellings — Quinart, Kinart, Quinaut — which is worth knowing before
2 CONT searching for her.
2 CONT
2 CONT ACT READ (2026-07-26): named, with [[thumas_georges_1772]], as a parent of the deceased in her
2 CONT son [[thumas_georges_1804]]'s death-act extract (S23) — *fils de Lambert Georges Thumas et de Marie
2 CONT Catherine Quinart, **décédés***.
2 CONT
2 CONT So she was dead by 28 September 1868, and her motherhood of Georges now rests on an act of
2 CONT civil registration rather than on a member tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT The extract writes her **Marie Catherine**, where this record carries *Marie Anne Catherine*
2 CONT and the variant *Kinart*. Both forms stand; the act's is recorded here as what the clerk
2 CONT wrote, not as a correction.
2 CONT
2 CONT MUDDIED, NOT DISPLACED (2026-07-27): [[netradyle-grez-naissances]] names her three times
2 CONT and the three do not agree with each other: `KINART Anne Catherine` (her own 1799 marriage
2 CONT index row), `KINAR Anne Catherine` (son Georges's 1804 birth), `KINART Marie Catherine
2 CONT (Basse Hespinne)` (son Georges Étienne's 1802 birth, i.e. [[thumas_etienne_1802]]). Anne
2 CONT Catherine versus Marie Catherine is a forename disagreement, not merely a spelling one.
2 CONT Against it stands [[S23]] — the only IMAGE read anywhere in this cluster — which names her
2 CONT **Marie Catherine Quinart**; an unauthenticated index split evenly against itself does not
2 CONT outweigh a register image. Confidence and the recorded forename are unchanged.
2 CONT
2 CONT FRONTIER: the KINART/QUINART surname tables at netradyle were never searched directly —
2 CONT she was only ever reached through her husband's and children's Thumas rows — and her own
2 CONT birth or baptismal record has not been sought at all.
