1 NOTE Named in his daughter Octavia's 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr. 258, S20), read as an
2 CONT image, as father of the bride: "Ludovicus Schalandrijn", werkman, resident at Oostende
2 CONT ("alhier wonende"), present and consenting. The act signs him "L. Schalandryn"; his
2 CONT daughter's own record spells the surname Schalandrijn, so the family name appears both
2 CONT ways in the same generation and this record follows the act's own spelling of him.
2 CONT
2 CONT FRONTIER — leads from the vrijwilligersrab civil-registration indexes (Huwelijken and
2 CONT Geboorten), none read at image level, so none of the following is recorded as fact
2 CONT here:
2 CONT
2 CONT - birth: Oudenburg, 29 January 1842 (act of 31 January 1842, nr. 14), naming his
2 CONT   parents as Ferdinandus Faustinus Schalandryn x Isabella Wallecan;
2 CONT - marriage to Mathilde Standaert: Oudenburg, 17 February 1871, act 17;
2 CONT - death: Oostende, 15 November 1916, per an Open Archives memorial card (fwk:a60b0372);
2 CONT - one generation further back, also index-only: Ferdinandus Faustinus Schalandryn's
2 CONT   parents Jacobus Schalandryn x Anna Devisschere, and Isabella Wallecan's parents
2 CONT   Henricus Wallecan x Joanna Vantornhoudt;
2 CONT - at least seven siblings of Octavia appear in the Geboorten index (rab-bs-geboorten) —
2 CONT   none are entered as records here.
2 CONT
2 CONT Each needs the underlying act image read before it becomes a fact; none is graftable
2 CONT on the index alone (verification pass, 2026-07-26).
