2 CONT framed** — he was mistakenly described in an earlier search as "a sixth child not in the
2 CONT tree"; he was already held here. What is new is his death: Oostende, 29 November 1905
2 CONT (Certificate Date 30/11/1905, a one-day offset), act nr. 810, RAB ID 500127. Sex M. The
2 CONT Detail's own Birth Date field reads 25/04/1905, matching this record's birth date exactly
