2 CONT FRONTIER — her husband. The same index names him **Desire Camille Gunst**, but he has no
2 CONT record of his own here: this pass is naming [[vaniseghem_eduardus_1880]] and [[vincke_emma_1880]]'s children,
2 CONT not their in-laws, so his own record is left for objective 2's next pass rather than
2 CONT entered now.
2 CONT
2 CONT RESOLVED (2026-07-27) — BIRTH DATE AND PLACE SUPPLIED, RECORD UPGRADED `sup` → `doc`. The
2 CONT open frontier below — a birth nine years before her parents' 1907 marriage — is answered
2 CONT directly by the marriage act's own legitimation clause, read as a register image
