2 CONT honderd acht en negentig" — their legitimate daughter, born Diksmuide 26 March 1898. The
2 CONT tie to the birth-index row below is by forename pair, day, month and year and commune —
2 CONT **not** by act reference, since the 1907 act cites no birth act number for her. This is a
2 CONT legitimation of a child already born, the same mechanism as [[dekeyser_edouard_1876]]'s marriage
2 CONT elsewhere in this tree, not an unrecorded earlier union.
2 CONT
2 CONT The birth-index sweep that first found her (incidental to an unrelated 1866-1870
2 CONT blind-window pass): "VINCKE Flavie Eulalie", b. Diksmuide 26 March 1898 act nr. 21, father
2 CONT NN NN, mother VINCKE Emma Celesta — registered under her mother's surname, exactly as the
2 CONT 1907 act itself also enters her (her two younger brothers are already entered there as
2 CONT Vanyseghem/Van Yseghem). A second such row, "VINCKE Albert Joseph" (b. Diksmuide 9
2 CONT December 1899 act nr. 84, d. Diksmuide 26 March 1900), is **not** named in the
