1 NOTE Son of [[vincke_lucien_1840]] and [[vanalderweireldt_ludovica_1845]], and [[vincke_emma_1880]]'s brother. His birth
2 CONT — Diksmuide act nr. 277, 30 December 1871 — is one of seven Diksmuide rows in the
2 CONT vrijwilligersrab Geboorten index (`rab-bs-geboorten`) naming both parents in full as
2 CONT Vincke Lucien Julianus x Vanalderweireldt Ludovica Maria, matching this couple exactly:
2 CONT the couple married 24 May 1865, so this is 6.6 years on. A province-wide sweep of the
